    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The detached outbuildings hereby permitted shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes incidental to the residential use of the occupiers of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;22 Barchester Road, Harrow Weald, Harrow, HA3 5HH&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and shall at no point be used as primary living accommodation, rental purposes or any other similar use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
